	KPJ	870525-2141	Add FATAL subroutine for TOPS-20, to handle
				random JSYS errors.
		Changed: FATAL@ERRLOG

	KPJ	1987-05-13 13:55:57	Assembly switch FTHALF for half-duplex
				support code.  Special handling for half
				duplex terminal password input. Use TRMBLK
				TRMOP. argument block if can't use ACs.  Name
				ENCRYP to ENKRYP to avoid name clash. Fix bug
				which destroys your own password saved in temp
				file if you CREATE USER or CHANGE PASSWORD for
				other user under CHANGE IDENTITY. Sanitize code
				also. Move password length to KOMMAC. ERRCOM
				and AMBCOM global, used to display error when
				subcommand is incorrect or ambiguous. Better
				error message when input does not match any
				command. Also, make it more like in PortaCOM.
				Make "Expected end of command" an error.
				Correct call to COMMAT in GTYPTA (the incorrect
				call made us mumble about "endline expected"
				when a command was ambiguous): return error
				code to GTTYTA. Add command (JOIN) MAILBOX as
				in PortaCOM.  Handle GTTYTA error codes.

		Changed: KOMMAC,(ASKPAS,ASKOPW,HALFP,HIDKEY,CHKPAS,DORMAT,
			ENKRYP,OLDNAM,SETPFL)@LOGIN,(GETPAS,CCHAPA,CRNEPE,
		       CHKNAM,ASKNPW,ASKNPA,CIDARG,ASKCID,ANONY,NEWNAM)@NEWNAM,
			KOMWRI@MONTMP,(GETMEN,ERRCOM,ENDARG,AMBCOM)@TOPCOM,
			(ZNOTRE,ZNOTR1,ZNOTR2,ZFLAAR,ZZJOIS,ZJOYCE)@TEXTER,
			(ALOEMP,ORGARG,ASKORG,CLOEMP,CHKEMP,AORGMA,CORGMA,
			ORMARK)@LOAEMP,ALISPE@LISPER,(GELNTY,GTYPTA)@ADD,
			REOBTY@CHATYP,ALISME@LISMEE,MEMTAB@ALLTAB,
			FLAARG@CHATAB,(JOISLF,JOYCE,JOINMT)@JOINMT

