KPJ	1985-04-04 20:02:58	Started elimination of the plethora of number
				printers. Included TOPS-20 compatible general
				number printer (NOUT%), and defined all the
				fields necessary to make it work on Tops-10.
				Made data base generate routine work on
				Tops-10 (crummy method). Fixed bug in DEFINE
				command. Included useful macros from TOPS-20
				MONSYM/MACSYM (FLD, POINTR etc).
				Moved macros to KOMMAC from DEFSPE.

KPJ	1985-03-28 13:21:43	Use standard TOPS-20 masks for version word.
				Use standard TOPS-20 macros to build fields.
				New label for version word. Rewrote version
				word output. This is now version 6A(1024)-6.
				Got rid of Welcome message when generating
				a new database. Instead, display what data base
				we try to generate. Fix error in ERROR macro.
				Make data base creation routine say what it
				does, and why. Change in SITE to make the
				TOPS-20 ASCIZ strings PRINTable (useless zero
				words inserted).

