KPJ	1985-01-25 14:24:18	(i) Allow presentations to be written with an
				external editor (they used to become garbled)
				by making the TMP: file commands prefixed by
				a command character ("!").
				(ii) Make upper casing of TMP file contents
				depend on a bug-fix-flag and only be done on
				Tops-10 (it fixes a bug in LOGIN/NAME: switch).
				(iii) Don't ask for presentations while we are
				writing an entry, since the presentation would
				destroy the entry we are writing.
				(iv) Make EDIT commands faster when writing a
				presentation by using object numbers instead.

	Changed: COMTMP@CALVID,TMPCON@MONTMP,GETPRE@JOINMT,KOMMAC

