KPJ	1984-10-04 12:53:09	Major hacking:

		WRIENT:	(USE) EDITOR AMIS put under FTQZ and T10.
			(USE) EDITOR EMACS for T20 not fully implemented yet.
		FILCON:	Editor modes on first line supported (used by EDIT,
			EMACS and AMIS)
		CALVID:	AMIS !(-*-Text Language Fill-*-), fill setting depends
			ACR settings. T10 and FTQZ only.
		KOMMAC:	stupid macros are .NODDT'ed
			Feature switches shown at compile time.
			Definition of personal flags re-written for the future.
		CHATAB:	NRFLAG variable deleted.
			Implemented new personal flag DOOR BELL. If off,
			bells are shown as ^G.
		LISPER:	Code cleanup.
		ENTCON:	Code cleanup (Martin NILsson's LISP-garbage etc)
		MONITO:	Code cleanup.
		ADDENT:	PNAMLI@ADDENT was identical to PRNALI@LOGIN. Deleted.
		NEWNAM:	Fixed misspelling
		MKMENU:	Code cleanup. Stupid macros crashed at run time.

