KPJ	1984-09-14 09:42:48	Rewrote TOPS-20 RUNFRK routine to not crash
				for evrything. It will now instead say what
				went wrong, and return failure. This also is
				a temporary fix to these errors:
	known bug #8	if you reset your editor fork outside KOM,
			you got "runfrk (sfrkv)" crash, with JSYS error
			"Invalid process handle". Now you will not crash.
	known bug #29	if you reset your EXEC fork outside KOM,
			you got "runfrk (sfrkv)" crash, with JSYS error
			"Invalid process handle". Now you will not crash.

